@startuml
actor Client
boundary LoginInterface
control LoginController
control AuthenticationService
boundary EvaluationFormInterface
control EvaluationFormController
database Database

Client -> LoginInterface: Access fixed website link
LoginInterface -> Client: Prompt for account and password
Client -> LoginInterface: Enter account and password
LoginInterface -> LoginController: Submit account and password
LoginController -> AuthenticationService: Validate account and password
AuthenticationService -> AuthenticationService: Check credentials validity
AuthenticationService --> LoginController: Confirm valid credentials
LoginController --> LoginInterface: Confirm valid credentials

LoginInterface -> EvaluationForm: Redirect to evaluation form
EvaluationForm -> EvaluationFormController: Request form access
EvaluationFormController -> EvaluationFormController: Verify client authorization
EvaluationFormController --> EvaluationForm: Confirm authorization
EvaluationForm --> Client: Display evaluation form

Client -> EvaluationForm: Fill in the evaluation form
EvaluationForm -> EvaluationFormController: Submit form data
EvaluationFormController -> Database: Save evaluation form data
Database --> EvaluationFormController: Confirm data saved
EvaluationFormController --> EvaluationForm: Confirm data saved
EvaluationForm --> Client: Display submission confirmation

LoginController -> LoginInterface: Show error if credentials are invalid (if needed)
LoginInterface --> Client: Display error message

@enduml